OL,3,GNEWSAFamilies living in a Travelodge
OL,4,Afor months after flat fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FNine families have spent almost three
OL,7,Fmonths living in a Travelodge hotel
OL,8,Fafter a fire broke out at their
OL,9,FBirmingham apartment block.
OL,11,FResidents of the nine-flat block in
OL,12,FSpreadbury Close, Harborne, were forced
OL,13,Fto leave their homes following the
OL,14,Fbin-store blaze on 12 August.
OL,16,FDespite being told electricity could be
OL,17,Frestored within days, the building
OL,18,Fremains uninhabitable and households
OL,19,Fare waiting to return.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
