OL,3,GNEWSAFamilies living in a Travelodge
OL,4,Afor months after flat fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FAmong the residents is Geoff Tedstone,
OL,7,Fwho has been staying in a Travelodge in
OL,8,FWest Bromwich with several neighbours.
